Proof files (.ots, .tsr, .tsq) are machine-generated records and may be
copied freely. FreeTSA's certificates (cacert.pem, tsa.crt) belong to
FreeTSA and are included only so the timestamps can be checked; obtain
them from https://freetsa.org to verify independently.
